      "timestamp_sec": 196,
      "why": "Reframes the goal from acquisition to reuse."
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not agent native. And it's obviously weak for coding tasks since it's just browser based.",
      "timestamp_sec": 328,
      "why": "The specific, checkable objection to NotebookLM."
